---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <h1>Hand off the busywork. Keep the business.</h1>
      <p class="lede">We find the repetitive work eating your week (inbox, sourcing, reports, follow-ups) and build AI agents that do it inside your own accounts.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.cal }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta="hero" data-channel="cal" aria-label="Book a 15-minute call on Cal.com (opens in a new tab)">Book a 15-min call</a>
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" data-cta="hero" data-channel="email">Prefer email? Write to us</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="trust">
        <li>Runs in accounts you own</li>
        <li>Your choice of AI provider</li>
        <li>Fixed price before we start</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <img class="sketch" src="/assets/illustrations/hero.png" alt="">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="problems-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="problems-title">Problems we take off your plate</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <img class="sketch problem-icon" src="/assets/illustrations/problem-inbox.png" alt="">
        <h3>Inbox &amp; DMs.</h3>
        <p>Every morning starts with a brief: what's urgent, what can wait, drafts ready to send.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <img class="sketch problem-icon" src="/assets/illustrations/problem-supplier-sourcing.png" alt="">
        <h3>Supplier sourcing.</h3>
        <p>Agents find, compare and shortlist suppliers or contacts, and put them straight into a sheet.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <img class="sketch problem-icon" src="/assets/illustrations/problem-finance-prep.png" alt="">
        <h3>Finance prep.</h3>
        <p>Invoices and receipts sorted and categorised, ready for your accountant.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <img class="sketch problem-icon" src="/assets/illustrations/problem-crm-upkeep.png" alt="">
        <h3>CRM upkeep.</h3>
        <p>Calls, emails and meetings logged automatically. No more "I'll update it later".</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <img class="sketch problem-icon" src="/assets/illustrations/problem-content.png" alt="">
        <h3>Content.</h3>
        <p>Drafts for posts and newsletters in your voice, and you approve them before anything goes out.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <img class="sketch problem-icon" src="/assets/illustrations/problem-reports.png" alt="">
        <h3>Reports.</h3>
        <p>Weekly numbers pulled from your tools into one readable summary.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="section-link"><a href="{{ site.cal }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta="problems" data-channel="cal">Not on the list? Tell us on the call<span class="visually-hidden"> on Cal.com (opens in a new tab)</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="how-title">How it works</h2>
    <img class="sketch how-sketch" src="/assets/illustrations/how-it-works.png" alt="">
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="frame">
        <p class="step-num">Step 1</p>
        <h3>A 15-minute call.</h3>
        <p>We map where your time goes and pick the workflows worth automating.</p>
      </article>
      <span class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <article class="frame">
        <p class="step-num">Step 2</p>
        <h3>A fixed-price plan.</h3>
        <p>You get a written scope and one price before any work starts. No hourly surprises.</p>
      </article>
      <span class="step-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <article class="frame">
        <p class="step-num">Step 3</p>
        <h3>A working system, then ongoing care.</h3>
        <p>We build it in your accounts and train your team. Then an optional monthly AI-management membership keeps the agents tuned, monitored and up to date.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="steps-cta"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.cal }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-cta="process" data-channel="cal" aria-label="Book a 15-minute call on Cal.com (opens in a new tab)">Book a 15-min call</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="proof" aria-labelledby="proof-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="proof-title">Proof</h2>
    <h3>Testimonials</h3>
    <div class="quotes">
      {% for person in testimonials %}
      <article class="quote">
        <blockquote><p>{{ person.quote }}</p></blockquote>
        <div class="who">
          <span class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">{{ person.initial }}</span>
          <div>
            <p class="name">{{ person.name }}</p>
            <p class="role">{% if person.role %}{{ person.role }} · {% endif %}<a href="{{ person.href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ person.company }}<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <article class="case" id="kaori">
      <h3>Kaori Media</h3>
      <p class="kicker">PR &amp; media agency: outreach and contact research automated.</p>
      <p class="section-link"><a href="/work/kaori-media/">Case study coming soon</a></p>
    </article>

    <div class="self-run">
      <div class="self-card">
        <h3>We run on it ourselves</h3>
        <p>LaunchBrick runs its own business on a team of 25+ AI agents for engineering, research, design and ops, coordinated by one orchestrator. We sell what we use every day.</p>
        <p class="claim">From the team behind 50+ shipped apps.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="figure">
        <img class="sketch" src="/assets/illustrations/proof-agent-org-chart.png" alt="Sketch of one orchestrator node fanning out to many agent nodes.">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

